lets a scraped page be acted on with clicks and form fills Scrape a page, then call /interact to take actions on it — click buttons, fill forms, navigate deeper, or extract dynamic content.\n- **v2.8.0:** This release brought parallel agent execution and a Firecrawl Skill for AI agents parallel agent execution via the new Spark 1 Fast model, a CLI tool covering scrape through crawl operations, and a Firecrawl Skill for Claude and other AI agents to autonomously invoke the platform.\n\nThe page snapshots are dated around April to May 2026, and the current date is October 2026, so a newer release may exist. Check https://github.com/firecrawl/firecrawl/releases for the authoritative latest version.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d8c6d0c-9aac-4300-a2ca-22ea8cec63ff","uuid":"208e23d6-a5b1-4940-909f-dda1790d3c2d","timestamp":"2026-10-17T17:50:55.847Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"firecrawl github releases latest release notes","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01WkuqkzDY3WM529P4bAdoAK","content":[{"title":"releases.sh","url":"https://releases.sh/firecrawl/firecrawl-github-releases/highlights"},{"title":"firecrawl github releases","url":"https://releases.sh/firecrawl/firecrawl-github-releases"},{"title":"forum.cloudron.io","url":"https://forum.cloudron.io/tags/firecrawl"},{"title":"releases.sh","url":"https://releases.sh/firecrawl"},{"title":"releases.sh","url":"https://releases.sh/firecrawl/firecrawl-changelog/highlights"},{"title":"rel rVsk52mw4NSzu46r kLxF","url":"https://releases.sh/release/rel_rVsk52mw4NSzu46r_kLxF"},{"title":"rel gMxC6lTJMPcnPd0 tY9Hm","url":"https://releases.sh/release/rel_gMxC6lTJMPcnPd0_tY9Hm"},{"title":"rel bVDJH4MYDfxZqsR1n1vIW","url":"https://releases.sh/release/rel_bVDJH4MYDfxZqsR1n1vIW"},{"title":"rel TDIMZcdG4QiqWRLgqV6tu","url":"https://releases.sh/release/rel_TDIMZcdG4QiqWRLgqV6tu"}]},"The most recent Firecrawl release i